          "block_label": "vision_footnote",
          "block_content": "Maximum (Max), minimum(Min) and standard deviations (Sd) of VACs in Stations 1 and 2 (units of  $ \\mu g\\ m^{-3} $). Mass composition (%), the ratio of concentrations in Stations 1 and 2 (S1/S2) and the concentration ratios compound/toluene are also shown. Limits of detection (LOD, ng m $ ^{-3} $) and compound recoveries (CR, %) are also reported",
